Backport of upstream CrispASR 6b699c8df + 188e21c1a (crispasr_vad_slices returns -3
when the VAD model cannot be loaded), plus one s4s addition not upstream yet: a Silero
inference failure (whisper_vad_segments_from_samples == NULL) also returns -3.
Without it, a missing/corrupt VAD model or a failed inference returned 0 slices,
which callers read as "audio has no speech" (silently empty transcripts).
Base used by s4s: 5b63ffeda (same libcrispasr source as local 9ceeab03).

